Hello All,

Our Fusion Bond Epoxy and standard Asphalt coatings for ductile iron fittin=
gs have NSF 61 listings. The "standard Asphalt" coating is the black coatin=
g that is standard on our DI fittings.

Fusion Bond Epoxy Coating:  Corvel 10-5110 Corvel Blue manufactured by Akzo=
 Noble Coatings, Inc, Reading, PA.

Bituminous Coating:  #9183 Asphalt Pipe Coating manufactured by R. N. Eaton=
 & Company, Inc, Riverside, MO.

The listings may be seen on the NSF web site http://www.nsf.org/Certified/P=
wsComponents/ .  Enter the manufacturer name and search.  In the case of th=
e Akzo Nobel fusion bond epoxy select the Reading, PA location.  Note listi=
ng for product model.

John

--_000_9B7E2735CEC37E4D9137A9548F21D78372545FCA21MAIL_
